    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Magus",
    "summary": "As the opposing player's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) starts, 1 **PSYKER** model of yours with this ability may use it. If it does, pick 1 enemy unit up to 18\" from it and roll a D6:\n\n- On a 1, D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** are dealt to the **PSYKER** model.\n- On a 2–5, attacks by the enemy unit's models get −1 to the **Hit roll** until the phase ends.\n- On a 6, attacks by the enemy unit's models get −1 to the Hit roll and −1 to the **Wound roll** for the rest of the phase.",
